            "review_title": "Review at Darcy Kitchen & Fine Bar",
            "review_text": "yuki.sato\n1 contribution\n0\nPerfect for Solo Travelers\nAug 2026 • Solo\nI visited Darcy while traveling alone in Ho Chi Minh City, and it turned out to be one of my favorite dining experiences. The atmosphere is beautiful, cozy, and elegant, making it a great place to relax after exploring the city.\n\nWhat impressed me the most was the service. The staff were incredibly friendly, attentive, and genuinely cared about making sure I had a great experience. Even though I was dining alone, they made me feel very welcome and comfortable throughout my visit.\n\nThe food was delicious, the cocktails were well made, and the prices were very reasonable considering the quality, location, and overall experience.\n\nIf you're visiting Ho Chi Minh City, whether you're traveling solo or with friends, I highly recommend Darcy. I would definitely come back on my next trip.\nRead more\nWritten August 3, 2026",
