            "review_title": "Review at Darcy Kitchen & Fine Bar",
            "review_text": "hado\n2 contributions\n0\nGreat place for a family dinner near Nguyen Hue Walking Street\nJul 2026 • Family\nI visited this restaurant with my family over the weekend and had a very pleasant experience. The space is beautifully designed in a classic and elegant style, creating a warm and cozy atmosphere without feeling overly formal. Every detail, from the furniture to the lighting, is thoughtfully arranged and adds a charming vintage touch.\n\nThe location is also very convenient, as it is close to Nguyen Hue Walking Street, so we could enjoy a nice walk after dinner.\n\nThe staff were one of the highlights of our visit. They were friendly, welcoming, and quick to assist us. Even during the busy dinner hours, the service remained polite and attentive.\n\nThe food was good overall and suitable for families. The menu offers a variety of dishes, the presentation is attractive, and the flavors are balanced enough for both adults and children. The ingredients tasted fresh and the portions were generous. While not every dish was outstanding, everything met our expectations.\n\nThe prices are reasonable considering the beautiful setting and central location. I would recommend this place for family gatherings, meeting friends, or hosting guests in a comfortable and stylish atmosphere. If I return to this area, I would be happy to visit again and try more dishes from the menu.\nRead more\nWritten August 3, 2026",
